  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell turns an oak tree into a protector or guardian. The spell can only be cast on a single tree at a time; while liveoak is in effect, you can't cast it again on another tree. Liveoak must be cast on a healthy, Huge oak. A triggering phrase of up to one word per caster level is placed on the targeted oak. The liveoak spell triggers the tree into animating as a treant.\n\nIf liveoak is dispelled, the tree takes root immediately wherever it happens to be. If released by you, the tree tries to return to its original location before taking root.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell turns an oak tree into a protector or guardian. the spell can only be cast on a single tree at a time; while liveoak is in effect, you can't cast it again on another tree. liveoak must be cast on a healthy, huge oak. a triggering phrase of up to one word per caster level is placed on the targeted oak. the liveoak spell triggers the tree into animating as a treant.\\n\\nif liveoak is dispelled, the tree takes root immediately wherever it happens to be. if released by you, the tree tries to return to its original location before taking root.\"",
